------------------------------------------------------------
----- BASE VIEW FOR ENTITY:      MJ: Integration Objects
-----               SCHEMA:      ${flyway:defaultSchema}
-----               BASE TABLE:  IntegrationObject
-----               PRIMARY KEY: ID
